---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftEvidenceTask
---
Construct a EvidenceTask draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Design the smallest authentic task that fills a consequential evidence gap. Tailor context and resources to the learner while preserving the competency, and specify what would count as success before the new work is submitted.
